    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Saya tidak begitu tahu banyak tentang apa yang disebut artefak alam
        ini, tapi saya yakin hal seperti itu pasti bisa berguna bagi orang-orang
        di zona pertempuran.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Saya tidak sanggup melakukannya!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Sebaiknya kau tinggalkan aku sendiri!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Apakah Anda menemukan bunker mereka?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Dan apa yang dikatakan bos mereka?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Ya Tuhan, ini sangat seksis dan rasis! Terima kasih atas kerja kerasmu,
        aku pergi dari sini!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Anda tidak ada hubungannya dengan itu. Selamat tinggal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Terima kasih!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].XP
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0427\u0442\u043E \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u0422\u0430\u043A \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0438 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0430\u0441\u0435\u043D, \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0435
        \u043D\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u0422\u0430\u043A \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0438 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u0443\u0436\u0430\u0441\u043D\u043E!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0437\u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u0443 \u043D\u0438\u0445
        \u0431\u044B\u043B\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0430\u044F \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0447\u0438\u043D\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0430 \u0431\u043B\u0438\u0436\u0430\u0439\u0448\u0435\u043C
        \u043C\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438\u043A\u0435 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C
        \u0443\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044B\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041F\u0440\u043E\u0449\u0430\u0439."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0435 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043D, \u043D\u043E \u044F
        \u043C\u043E\u0433\u0443 \u0441\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0438\u0442\u044C,
        \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0443 \u0438\u0445."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041F\u0440\u043E\u0449\u0430\u0439."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E, \u044F \u043F\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u0443\u044E
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0447\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0430, \u043F\u043E\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0443\u0439, \u044D\u0442\u043E
        \u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041A\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0439 \u0437\u0435\u043B\u0435\u043D\u044B\u0439
        \u0448\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043A?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0412\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0435\u043C\u0441\u044F \u043A \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0438\u043C
        \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041A\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0439 \u0437\u0435\u043B\u0435\u043D\u044B\u0439
        \u0448\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043A?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0412\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0435\u043C\u0441\u044F \u043A \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0438\u043C
        \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0418\u0437\u0432\u0438\u043D\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Quest
      value: -1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Skill
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0430, \u044F \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043B \u0438\u0445."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0432 \u043F\u043E\u0438\u0441\u043A\u0430\u0445."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041E\u043D \u043D\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0437\u044F\u0442\u044C
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F. \u0422\u044B \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0436\u0430\u044F
        \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B
        \u0441 \u043D\u0438\u043C, \u0438\u0437\u0432\u0438\u043D\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041C\u043D\u0435 \u0436\u0430\u043B\u044C, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u0430\u043A
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B
        \u0441 \u043D\u0438\u043C, \u0438\u0437\u0432\u0438\u043D\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0423\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B
        \u0441 \u043D\u0438\u043C, \u0438\u0437\u0432\u0438\u043D\u0438."
