    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.size
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0423 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u043E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u043D\u043E \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0432
        \u043D\u0430 \u043A\u043E\u043B \u0441\u0430\u0436\u0430\u044E\u0442, \u0430
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043F\u0440\u043E\u043F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0438...
        \u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0443\u0436 \u043D\u0435 \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u043B,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0433\u0443\u0442
        \u0443\u0434\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041C\u0430\u044F\u043A? \u0422\u044B \u0436\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435\u0432\u043E\u0437\u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E.
        \u0425\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0440\u043E\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043A \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u043C\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0443?
        \u0422\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0434\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u044E
        \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0435\u043E\u043F\u044B\u0442\u043D\u044B\u0439
        \u0434\u0443\u0448\u0438... \u041E\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0439
        \u0445\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0436\u043D\u0438\u043A-\u0436\u0443\u043B\u0438\u043A
        \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u043E\u0431\u0434\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0433\u043E. \u041F\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F
        \u043E\u0442\u0440\u0443\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
        \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0425\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0436\u043D\u0438\u043A, \u0447\u0442\u043E
        \u043B\u0438? \u0425\u043C\u043C, \u043F\u043E\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0443\u0439,
        \u0442\u044B \u043F\u043E\u0445\u043E\u0436 \u043D\u0430 \u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0438\u0437 \u043D\u0438\u0445. \u041F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0442\u0430\u043A,
        \u044F \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0448\u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
        \u043E\u0431\u043E\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0438
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0430\u0441\u043C\u043E\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043B\u0441\u044F?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u043F\u043E\u043F\u044B\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u044F \u043D\u0435\u043C\u0435\u0434\u043B\u0435\u043D\u043D\u043E
        \u043E\u0442\u0440\u0443\u0431\u043B\u044E \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u043E\u0440 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u0434\u0430.
        \u041B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443 \u0441 \u043F\u043B\u0435\u0447,
        \u043B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u0434\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0441\u0432\u043E\u044E \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0421\u043B\u0443\u0448\u0430\u0439 \u0441\u044E\u0434\u0430, \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442,
        \u043D\u0430 \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043C \u0431\u0435\u0437\u0437\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C
        \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u043E\u0434\u043D\u0430
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043B\u0435\u043C\u0430 - \u043F\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0438\u0442\u044B.
        \u041D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438
        \u0434\u0435\u0437\u0438\u043D\u0444\u0435\u043A\u0446\u0438\u044E \u0432
        \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0445."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041A\u0430\u043A \u0436\u0435 \u0442\u044B \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0437\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0430\u0442\u044C \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u044B,
        \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0434\u0430\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432
        \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445 \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0435
        \u0441\u043F\u043E\u0441\u043E\u0431\u0435\u043D?! \u041D\u0435\u0442, \u0442\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0439
        \u043F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0439 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0435
        \u043D\u0435\u0442\u0443 \u043C\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0430 \u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043B\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0445..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E, \u043F\u043E\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044F\u044E
        \u0432 \u043F\u043E\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043D\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437.
        \u0412 \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0445 \u043F\u043E\u0434 \u043D\u0430\u043C\u0438
        \u0432\u043E\u0434\u044F\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0434\u0438\u043A\u0438\u0435
        \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0435, \u0438\u0445 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u044B
        \u0441\u0438\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E \u043E\u0431\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B\u043E,
        \u043D\u043E \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0442\u0430\u043C \u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0435\u0449\u0435,
        \u0442\u043E \u0432 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u044B\u0445 \u043D\u0435 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0439.
        \u041F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u044B
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0437\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0435\u043D\u044B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442? \u041D\u0430\u0434\u0435\u044E\u0441\u044C,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B \u0441 \u0445\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u0438\u043C\u0438
        \u043D\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044F\u043C\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0438 \u0441\u043B\u0430\u0432\u043D\u043E. \u041D\u0435
        \u0442\u0430\u043A \u0443\u0436 \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043D\u043E, \u043D\u0435
        \u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430 \u043B\u0438?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u043F\u0435\u0440\u044C \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u044E\u0431\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043E\u0442\u0430\u043C\u0438. \u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438,
        \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043A\u043B\u044E\u0447\u0438 \u043E\u0442 \u043C\u0430\u044F\u043A\u0430.
        \u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0443\u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044C \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0435
        \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043B\u043E, \u0442\u043E \u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0438
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0438\u0437\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u044B \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0435
        \u043D\u0435 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043D. \u0422\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435
        \u0438\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0437\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C \u0441 \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445
        \u0433\u043B\u0430\u0437, \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u0442\u0432\u043E\u044F
        \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0430 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0446\u0435\u043B\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0423 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u043E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u043D\u043E \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0432
        \u043D\u0430 \u043A\u043E\u043B \u0441\u0430\u0436\u0430\u044E\u0442, \u0430
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043F\u0440\u043E\u043F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0438...
        \u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0443\u0436 \u043D\u0435 \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u043B,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0433\u0443\u0442
        \u0443\u0434\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041C\u0430\u044F\u043A? \u0422\u044B \u0436\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435\u0432\u043E\u0437\u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E.
        \u0425\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0440\u043E\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043A \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u043C\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0443?
        \u0422\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0434\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u044E
        \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0435\u043E\u043F\u044B\u0442\u043D\u044B\u0439
        \u0434\u0443\u0448\u0438... \u041E\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0439
        \u0445\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0436\u043D\u0438\u043A-\u0436\u0443\u043B\u0438\u043A
        \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u043E\u0431\u0434\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0433\u043E. \u041F\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F
        \u043E\u0442\u0440\u0443\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
        \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0425\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0436\u043D\u0438\u043A, \u0447\u0442\u043E
        \u043B\u0438? \u0425\u043C\u043C, \u043F\u043E\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0443\u0439,
        \u0442\u044B \u043F\u043E\u0445\u043E\u0436 \u043D\u0430 \u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0438\u0437 \u043D\u0438\u0445. \u041F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0442\u0430\u043A,
        \u044F \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0448\u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
        \u043E\u0431\u043E\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0438
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0430\u0441\u043C\u043E\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043B\u0441\u044F?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u043F\u043E\u043F\u044B\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u044F \u043D\u0435\u043C\u0435\u0434\u043B\u0435\u043D\u043D\u043E
        \u043E\u0442\u0440\u0443\u0431\u043B\u044E \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u043E\u0440 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u0434\u0430.
        \u041B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0443 \u0441 \u043F\u043B\u0435\u0447,
        \u043B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u0434\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0441\u0432\u043E\u044E \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0421\u043B\u0443\u0448\u0430\u0439 \u0441\u044E\u0434\u0430, \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442,
        \u043D\u0430 \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043C \u0431\u0435\u0437\u0437\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C
        \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u043E\u0434\u043D\u0430
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043B\u0435\u043C\u0430 - \u043F\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0438\u0442\u044B.
        \u041D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438
        \u0434\u0435\u0437\u0438\u043D\u0444\u0435\u043A\u0446\u0438\u044E \u0432
        \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0445."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041A\u0430\u043A \u0436\u0435 \u0442\u044B \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0437\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0430\u0442\u044C \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u044B,
        \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0434\u0430\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432
        \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445 \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0435
        \u0441\u043F\u043E\u0441\u043E\u0431\u0435\u043D?! \u041D\u0435\u0442, \u0442\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0439
        \u043F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0439 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0435
        \u043D\u0435\u0442\u0443 \u043C\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0430 \u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043B\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0445..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engMaleNPCText
      value: We usually impale tourists, but they let you through... I didn't think
        they could surprise me anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E, \u043F\u043E\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044F\u044E
        \u0432 \u043F\u043E\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043D\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437.
        \u0412 \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0445 \u043F\u043E\u0434 \u043D\u0430\u043C\u0438
        \u0432\u043E\u0434\u044F\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0434\u0438\u043A\u0438\u0435
        \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0435, \u0438\u0445 \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u044B
        \u0441\u0438\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E \u043E\u0431\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B\u043E,
        \u043D\u043E \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0442\u0430\u043C \u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0435\u0449\u0435,
        \u0442\u043E \u0432 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u044B\u0445 \u043D\u0435 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0439.
        \u041F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u044B
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0437\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0435\u043D\u044B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442? \u041D\u0430\u0434\u0435\u044E\u0441\u044C,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B \u0441 \u0445\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u0438\u043C\u0438
        \u043D\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044F\u043C\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0438 \u0441\u043B\u0430\u0432\u043D\u043E. \u041D\u0435
        \u0442\u0430\u043A \u0443\u0436 \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043D\u043E, \u043D\u0435
        \u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430 \u043B\u0438?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u043F\u0435\u0440\u044C \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u044E\u0431\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043E\u0442\u0430\u043C\u0438. \u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438,
        \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043A\u043B\u044E\u0447\u0438 \u043E\u0442 \u043C\u0430\u044F\u043A\u0430.
        \u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u0443\u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044C \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0435
        \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043B\u043E, \u0442\u043E \u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0438
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u0438\u0437\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044C!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0422\u044B \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0435
        \u043D\u0435 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u0430. \u0422\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435
        \u0438\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0437\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C \u0441 \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445
        \u0433\u043B\u0430\u0437, \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u0442\u0432\u043E\u044F
        \u0433\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0430 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0446\u0435\u043B\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engMaleNPCText
      value: The lighthouse? You know that's impossible. Do you want to touch the
        natural light? Then prove your loyalty.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engMaleNPCText
      value: The mistake of an inexperienced soul... Another rogue artist wants to
        fool the old one. I'll have to chop off your head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engMaleNPCText
      value: An artist, perhaps? Hmm, I guess you look like one of them. Even so,
        I'll let you explore our open spaces.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engMaleNPCText
      value: Have you seen enough?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engMaleNPCText
      value: Then death.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engMaleNPCText
      value: If you try to get out, I will immediately chop off your head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engMaleNPCText
      value: There is always a choice. Either get your head off your shoulders, or
        prove your loyalty.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engMaleNPCText
      value: Listen here, tourist, there is one problem on our carefree island -
        parasites. We need to disinfect the caves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engMaleNPCText
      value: How are you going to clean the caves if you can't even understand my
        words?! No, such an empty head has no place on your shoulders...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engMaleNPCText
      value: Okay, I repeat for the last time. There are wild skinless creatures
        in the caves below us, their heads have been heavily irradiated, but if you
        find someone else there, then don't leave them alive. The caves must be cleared.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engMaleNPCText
      value: A tourist? I hope you have good news.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engMaleNPCText
      value: That's nice. It's not that hard, is it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engMaleNPCText
      value: Now you can admire the beauties. Here, these are the keys to the lighthouse.
        If you try to steal a natural luminary, you will not escape death!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].engMaleNPCText
      value: I don't need you anymore. You better get out of my sight while your
        head is still intact.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engFemaleNPCText
      value: We usually impale tourists, but they let you through... I didn't think
        they could surprise me anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engFemaleNPCText
      value: The lighthouse? You know that's impossible. Do you want to touch the
        natural light? Then prove your loyalty.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engFemaleNPCText
      value: The mistake of an inexperienced soul... Another rogue artist wants to
        fool the old one. I'll have to chop off your head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engFemaleNPCText
      value: An artist, perhaps? Hmm, I guess you look like one of them. Even so,
        I'll let you explore our open spaces.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Have you seen enough?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Then death.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engFemaleNPCText
      value: If you try to get out, I will immediately chop off your head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engFemaleNPCText
      value: There is always a choice. Either get your head off your shoulders, or
        prove your loyalty.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Listen here, tourist, there is one problem on our carefree island -
        parasites. We need to disinfect the caves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engFemaleNPCText
      value: How are you going to clean the caves if you can't even understand my
        words?! No, such an empty head has no place on your shoulders...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Okay, I repeat for the last time. There are wild skinless creatures
        in the caves below us, their heads have been heavily irradiated, but if you
        find someone else there, then don't leave them alive. The caves must be cleared.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engFemaleNPCText
      value: A tourist? I hope you have good news.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engFemaleNPCText
      value: That's nice. It's not that hard, is it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Now you can admire the beauties. Here, these are the keys to the lighthouse.
        If you try to steal a natural luminary, you will not escape death!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I don't need you anymore. You better get out of my sight while your
        head is still intact.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kami biasanya menusuk turis, tetapi mereka membiarkan Anda lewat...
        Saya tidak berpikir mereka bisa mengejutkan saya lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Sebuah mercusuar? Anda tahu itu tidak mungkin. Apakah Anda ingin menyentuh
        cahaya alami? Kemudian buktikan kesetiaanmu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kesalahan jiwa yang tidak berpengalaman... Artis nakal lain ingin membodohi
        yang lama. Aku harus memenggal kepalamu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Seorang seniman, mungkin? Hmm, saya kira Anda terlihat seperti salah
        satu dari mereka. Meski begitu, saya akan membiarkan Anda menjelajahi ruang
        terbuka kami.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Apakah Anda sudah cukup melihat?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Lalu kematian.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Jika kamu mencoba keluar, aku akan segera memenggal kepalamu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Selalu ada pilihan. Lepaskan kepalamu dari bahumu, atau buktikan kesetiaanmu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Dengarkan di sini, turis, ada satu masalah di pulau riang kita-parasit.
        Kita perlu mendisinfeksi gua.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Bagaimana Anda akan membersihkan gua jika Anda bahkan tidak dapat memahami
        kata-kata saya?! Tidak, kepala kosong seperti itu tidak memiliki tempat di
        pundak Anda...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Oke, saya ulangi untuk terakhir kalinya. Ada makhluk liar tanpa kulit
        di gua-gua di bawah kita, kepala mereka telah disinari secara berlebihan,
        tetapi jika Anda menemukan orang lain di sana, jangan biarkan mereka hidup-hidup.
        Gua-gua harus dibersihkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Seorang turis? Saya harap Anda mendapat kabar baik.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Itu bagus. Tidak sesulit itu, bukan?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Sekarang Anda bisa mengagumi keindahannya. Di sini, ini adalah kunci
        mercusuar. Jika Anda mencoba mencuri seorang termasyhur alami, Anda tidak
        akan luput dari kematian!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Aku tidak membutuhkanmu lagi. Anda lebih baik menjauh dari pandangan
        saya saat kepala Anda masih utuh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Kami biasanya menusuk turis, tetapi mereka membiarkan Anda lewat...
        Saya tidak berpikir mereka bisa mengejutkan saya lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
