    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: I'm not interested in the sun, just the magnificent view.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngText
      value: I'll prove myself worthy. What do I need to do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].EngText
      value: What if I don't want to?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: You have no right!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Great.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Yes, thank you very much.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: It's a really difficult choice. I will help.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngText
      value: I choose death, but yours.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Wow! Is there an option without decapitation?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Let's have loyalty instead.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngText
      value: I choose death!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: I don't understand, can I give you more details?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngText
      value: I get it, I don't need any more details.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Fuck...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].FailNode
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: I see now, thanks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: I've cleared the caves. There are no more pests.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngText
      value: The cave cleanup is in full swing. I'll be back later.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: That's for sure...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Don't worry, I'm not going to steal anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngText
      value: Understood, I'm leaving.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
