      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].FemaleText
      value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u0442\u043E\u0447\u043D\u043E..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].answerType
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].FemaleText
      value: "\u0417\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043A\u0430 \u043F\u0435\u0449\u0435\u0440
        \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043D\u044B\u043C \u0445\u043E\u0434\u043E\u043C.
        \u0412\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0441\u044C \u043F\u043E\u0437\u0436\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].FemaleText
      value: "\u041D\u0435 \u0432\u043E\u043B\u043D\u0443\u0439\u0441\u044F, \u044F
        \u043D\u0435 \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u044E\u0441\u044C \u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E
        \u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].answerType
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].FemaleText
      value: "\u041F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u043B\u0430, \u0443\u0445\u043E\u0436\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].answerType
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].NeedComplete
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].NeedComplete
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I want to climb the lighthouse.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I think I've got the wrong tent... I have to go.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].NeedComplete
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].NeedComplete
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I'm not interested in the sun, just the magnificent view.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I'll prove myself worthy. What do I need to do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].EngFemaleText
      value: What if I don't want to?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: You have no right!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Great.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Yes, thank you very much.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: It's a really difficult choice. I will help.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I choose death, but yours.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Wow! Is there an option without decapitation?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Let's have loyalty instead.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I choose death!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I don't understand, can I give you more details?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: I get it, I don't need any more details.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Fuck...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Saya ingin mendaki mercusuar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya pikir saya salah tenda... Aku harus pergi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I see now, thanks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: I've cleaned out the caves. There are no more pests.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].EngFemaleText
      value: The cave cleanup is in full swing. I'll be back later.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: That's for sure...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Don't worry, I'm not going to steal anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].EngFemaleText
      value: Understood, I'm leaving.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Saya hanya tertarik dengan pemandangan yang mewah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Aku akan membuktikan diriku layak. Apa yang harus kulakukan?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].IndonesianText
      value: Bagaimana jika saya tidak mau?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Kamu tidak punya hak!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Bagus.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ya, terima kasih banyak.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Ini adalah pilihan yang sangat sulit. Aku akan membantu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya memilih kematian, tapi kematian Anda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Wow! Apakah ada pilihan tanpa pemenggalan kepala?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Mari kita memiliki kesetiaan sebagai gantinya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Lepaskan kepalamu dari bahumu!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Bisakah saya mendapatkan detail lebih lanjut?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Saya mengerti, saya tidak perlu detail lebih lanjut.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Sial...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Saya mengerti sekarang, terima kasih.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Aku sudah membersihkan gua. Tidak ada lagi hama.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianText
      value: Pembersihan gua sedang berjalan lancar. Aku akan kembali lagi nanti.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianText
      value: Itu sudah pasti...
